OL,3,GNEWSA'Tear out disaster seafront
OL,4,Alagoon,' council told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA seafront lagoon branded a "disaster"
OL,7,Fby a councillor could be ripped out
OL,8,Fafter years of problems.
OL,10,FThree Shells Lagoon in Southend-on-Sea
OL,11,Fhad been "flawed from the very start",
OL,12,Fcity councillor Matt Dent told a
OL,13,Fmeeting of the local authority.
OL,15,FIt opened at a cost of #1.9m in 2016 to
OL,16,Fboost tourism in the Essex city, but
OL,17,Fhas faced drained problems and foul
OL,18,Fsmells.
OL,20,FThe Labour-led council said its cabinet
OL,21,Fwould determine the attraction's future
OL,22,Fin November.
